=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>索引之间会有多少个元素？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"没有","text_html":"<p>没有</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"1个","text_html":"<p>1个</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"2个","text_html":"<p>2个</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":145,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"在while语句中要检查什么条件？","question_text_html":"<p>在while语句中要检查什么条件？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"left + 1 < right\n","text_html":"<p>left + 1 &lt; right</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"left <= right\n","text_html":"<p>left &lt;= right</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"left < right\n","text_html":"<p>left &lt; right</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":146,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"如果$nums[mid]<target$，需要在右边空间搜索，该怎么做？","question_text_html":"<p>如果<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>[</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nums[mid]&lt;target</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">d</span><span class=\"