">g</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">t</span></span></span></span>，需要在左边空间搜索，该怎么做？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"right = mid\n","text_html":"<p>right = mid</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":true},{"text":"right = mid - 1\n\n","text_html":"<p>right = mid - 1</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"right = 数组大小\n","text_html":"<p>right = 数组大小</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false}]},{"question_id":148,"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"二分查找算法的**时间复杂度**是多少？","question_text_html":"<p>二分查找算法的<strong>时间复杂度</strong>是多少？</p>\n","question_options":[{"text":"$O(n)$\n\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"","md_html":""},"correct":false},{"text":"$O(log_2(n))$\n","text_html":"<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=